### ============================================
### USER SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/auth
@id = 1
@referenceId = 1

### User signup with phone/email and password
### Request Body: SignupRequest
### Response: No content (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Markcus",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "email": "markcus0526@atomicmail.io",
  "password": "***REMOVED***"
}

### User signin with phone + SMS code or email + password
### Request Body: SigninRequest
### Response: "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "user1@tuttime.com",
  "passwordOrCode": "***REMOVED***"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### Request SMS verification code for phone number
### Request Body: SmsVerificationRequest
### Response: No content (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/sms/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

### Verify SMS code sent to phone
### Request Body: SmsCodeVerificationRequest
### Response: No content (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/sms/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Request password reset email
### Request Body: PasswordResetRequest
### Response: No content (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/password/reset-request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Confirm password reset with token and new password
### Request Body: PasswordResetConfirmRequest
### Response: No content (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/password/reset-confirm
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "***REMOVED***",
  "newPassword": "***REMOVED***"
}

### Send email verification link
### Request Body: email passed as request param
### Response: No content (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/email/send-verification?email=user@example.com HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Verify email by token
### Request Body: token passed as request param
### Response: No content (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/email/verify?token={{token}} HTTP/1.1
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json